# Optional deps here (e.g. tinyglobby's optional picomatch@4 peer, pulled in transitively by
# firebase-tools) resolve inconsistently across platforms/npm versions -- present in the
# lockfile but not actually installed on Windows/npm 11, which `npm ci` on CI's Linux/npm 10
# runner then flags as "Missing: picomatch@4.0.7 from lock file" even though nothing in this
# directory's own scripts needs it. Omitting optional deps entirely sidesteps the whole class
# of platform-dependent lockfile drift for this internal tooling directory.
omit=optional
